{"event_type":"review","id":"4dad9f58a60e8e5dbbad39f1a57363262deafdc298ebd7f41634f0e2a242391e","occurred_at":"2026-11-08T00:26:28Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/bef37fd17696ca7ae40b43612ced9121319692d03bdbabf311fe59f416512748","sha256":"bef37fd17696ca7ae40b43612ced9121319692d03bdbabf311fe59f416512748"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4998a4bc3c7fa4f694c821111fce7eea0ec0295224b0a3b94785ccf399ea0602","sha256":"4998a4bc3c7fa4f694c821111fce7eea0ec0295224b0a3b94785ccf399ea0602"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4c79467f9458faad522628bc728bc0c9b6f654ce7586d822ff2c7ded23cfc73c","sha256":"4c79467f9458faad522628bc728bc0c9b6f654ce7586d822ff2c7ded23cfc73c"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/bce1a2249183f318b12521263186fa830f786132619fadefbc863ee754efc8a9","sha256":"bce1a2249183f318b12521263186fa830f786132619fadefbc863ee754efc8a9"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d95d66c002013ec78ea8d835ce4ad344f24b3cc3d2ee5414b01e4783c5c0839f","sha256":"d95d66c002013ec78ea8d835ce4ad344f24b3cc3d2ee5414b01e4783c5c0839f"}],"attempt_id":"58ac2061d655d08f324e620fa63adc653de50d386352fbb1e1ea727a49517067:0:1","base":"58c2b2c795c7c3aaddaf7b1f21ef7ba34edae32a","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"f7ca9c48eda2d5d81a45f21cb9bbf5890063331c","body":"**Strip a leading UTF-8 BOM before parsing a tsconfig.**\n\n`gitReadBlob` decodes the blob with `toString('utf8')`, which keeps a leading `\\uFEFF`. `stripJsonc` passes that character through, so `JSON.parse` throws.\n\nThe `catch` at Line 302 then treats the file as unparsable and skips its `extends` and `references` edges. As far as I know, `tsc` strips the BOM and follows those edges. The result is that definition paths reachable only through a BOM-prefixed tsconfig are missing from the graph. This breaks the stated goal at Lines 152-156 that a graph must not silently drop definition paths.\n\nStrip the BOM before parsing.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-      config = JSON.parse(stripJsonc(text));\n+      config = JSON.parse(stripJsonc(text.replace(/^\\uFEFF/, '')));\n```\n</details>","id":"11bca43db5c9a54bf8ed99b8cc028123fd79c828b9d1ff60a484e77ee2fd1310","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/ratchet/internal/definitions.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Strip a leading UTF-8 BOM before parsing a tsconfig."}],"head":"6dfe11daedcce7805424d9ffb3c9d62442d3742d","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"f7ca9c48eda2d5d81a45f21cb9bbf5890063331c","intervals":[[1,312]],"path":"src/ops/ratchet/internal/definitions.ts"}],"job_id":"58ac2061d655d08f324e620fa63adc653de50d386352fbb1e1ea727a49517067:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"f7ca9c48eda2d5d81a45f21cb9bbf5890063331c","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/ratchet/internal/definitions.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"3aee477168e1da8e2aa232a98e80747d98da8f26f54f2a27e0c62d13e349d4b1","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"f7ca9c48eda2d5d81a45f21cb9bbf5890063331c","intervals":[[1,312]],"path":"src/ops/ratchet/internal/definitions.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"f7ca9c48eda2d5d81a45f21cb9bbf5890063331c","intervals":[[1,312]],"path":"src/ops/ratchet/internal/definitions.ts"}],"scope_digest":"cf398441f449302d4e6526217027761006c66b144017939d250a62d1017af3f1","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-58ac2061d655d08f324e620fa63adc653de50d386352fbb1e1ea727a49517067-g0-20261108T002511Z","producer":"crq-runner-app","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","type":"crq-run"},"subject_id":"58ac2061d655d08f324e620fa63adc653de50d386352f